- **Adding a listener without removing it.** If you call `_emailController.addListener(...)` or `_shakeController.addStatusListener(...)`, remove it in `dispose()` as well — or, better, drive the rebuild through `AnimatedBuilder`/`ListenableBuilder` instead of a manual listener + `setState`, which eliminates the cleanup entirely.
